        <mxCell id="app_rules" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;fontSize=12;align=left;spacing=8;" value="&lt;b&gt;Application-enforced business rules&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• Users must be 18+ to register.&lt;br/&gt;• Sold listings are hidden from normal browsing.&lt;br/&gt;• Only participants in a completed, unlocked request may review.&lt;br/&gt;• Each participant may submit at most one review, giving at most two reviews per request.&lt;br/&gt;• Administrators may lock records but do not determine transaction outcomes." vertex="1">
